        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-19T12:30:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>You could perhaps add a clause that H-2 effects would still give 1? That would still give it some use while not borking up lots of cards...</p>",
