        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-11-22T15:04:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the card could work well if there was a cost. &nbsp;Having it just an ongoing makes it potentially too powerful as there is no maintenance cost.</p><p>Discarding a card each round to keep it out, or even a rule 15 damage clause would balance it. &nbsp;Fortitude needs Legacy to be highest HP or lead from the front to work, and then only vs. villains. &nbsp;Next Evolution costs a power each round, and again lead from the front or Legacy being the only one targetted.</p><p>(H)-1 gives a lot of benefit to the whole team, and it requires no other cards to work well, and as written no cost to keep the effect.</p><p>I would go with the discard each round, or maybe a clause that if the villain does not deal damage for an entire round the card is destroyed.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>As for the contest, do we have any idea when the winner will be announced?</p>",
        "post_number": 29,
